{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3089f3d3f2be4ee6452da0412da1bbd6a3e9ddc536a81a2ad5c1b93b4cd15a26", "ja": "マイペース、だからこそ", "zh": "正因是我的步调", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0a1da378e2e4619eb3314fb1f9f1eaf22f699a27e15b9a24c6cb1120b1e31c7e", "ja": "そして迎えた公演当日。できあがったセトリ\nは、朋花、まつり、美也の希望をすべて\n叶えた、それぞれの方向性がバラバラだから\nこそ補完しあい、綺麗にまとまった、『マイ\nペースユニット』ならではのものだった。", "zh": "终于迎来了公演当天。完成的演出曲目表\n实现了朋花、茉莉、美也的所有愿望，正因为\n三人的方向各不相同，才能彼此互补，完美地\n组合在一起，成为只有“我行我素组合”才能\n呈现的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "d87e9f16b90b98f4767a8533867e6c4c00d2ff8e4cd1137f3009e6c70f20fb56", "ja": "公演当日……", "zh": "公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "770b2f30af3c3d8948847ace0daf1c93d80acd969246db1139bc17f7ee88c457", "ja": "いよいよ本番ですね～。\nたくさんレッスンした分、たくさん頑張りましょう～♪", "zh": "终于要正式开演了呢～。\n既然练了那么多，就要拿出加倍的干劲加油哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "27176f8334f9b43d750e509485d276b5ca94e9c3319921749bd450db2d38d56c", "ja": "姫たちの希望、無理やり一つにまとめるとは思わな\nかったのです。プロデューサーさんは鬼なのです。", "zh": "没想到竟然会把公主她们的希望硬是整合在一起呢。制作人先生真是个魔鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "a8ba9fbf1a1b2c76c2fdb775c975491b4efe98f19b4a523f7da0461f47d8da89", "ja": "まつりさんの希望が\n無茶すぎたんじゃありませんか～？", "zh": "是不是因为茉莉小姐的愿望\n太乱来了呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c87f67f8d089c89dc85aa4fc1927337ac02552a527aa27bb94a62494264f7cb", "ja": "朋花ちゃんの希望リストも、とっても無茶でしたから\nね～。あれでは仕方ありませんな～。", "zh": "朋花的愿望清单也太过分了嘛～。那样的话也没办法呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "8120c9e5d896b2c6bd16b28dd0ada3a9644fca71a3d34d1656e18900a24ca457", "ja": "美也さんもですよ～？/美也ちゃんもなのですよ？", "zh": "美也也是哦～？/美也也是这样哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "020ee8d994d743794a72f4ae6e67a2483bd7af24826d88e9e06cb12b3ac08287", "ja": "美也ちゃんもなのですよ？", "zh": "美也也是哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "2eb0a51b8a04027a72b1381c07160f344a3b9b76a74cdab084dfda6d9f42c1a1", "ja": "お～、そういえばそうでした～。", "zh": "哦～，说起来确实是这样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "d48193f6bb49798fef12fa5b7b7b22dbdd4d0acf139b030f1a9dd0edaa89d56f", "ja": "（ミーティングから公演当日まで\n3人はずっとこの調子だった）", "zh": "（从碰头会一直到公演当天，3个人始终都是这个样子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "170c24533e6a05d5ccf9a5e43da5371e1e14511a052db09080648f5c71355891", "ja": "（そう。この3人は、片時も離れない仲良しとかじゃ\nないけど、ずっと張り合ってるわけでもなくて……）", "zh": "（是的，这3个人虽然不是形影不离的要好朋友，也不是一直在互相较劲……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "8e34dec36cf35a5f58e619630a1bd10f3282db2b7af426d8e69d6f034e574e2f", "ja": "プロデューサーさんも、\n物思いにふけってる場合じゃないのですよ？", "zh": "制作人也不是沉思的时候哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "6d7118496236cf3dcc0dfeaeb98a12f90d48c2759de96ba995362f3697878fb2", "ja": "あ、ごめんごめん。\nえっと～、何の話だっけ？", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉。\n那个～，我们刚才聊到哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "7fec5d4df3ea7f998e299afd6576528640a37f7f9da89dd684c181f824e4f8a3", "ja": "セットリストのお話なのです！　出番が多いのに\nパターンが不規則で、姫たちはてんてこまいなのです！", "zh": "是演出曲目表的事哦！明明要上场很多次，安排又不规律，公主们都忙得团团转了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "fba1896cd8fca96128034260fe3fb73ef914b5a767bd9fd5d47ab9746d18c7ca", "ja": "どう調整するのかと思っていたら、1曲を短くして\n全部入れ込むなんて。意外と強引なんですね～？", "zh": "我还在想要怎么调整呢，没想到竟然把1首歌都缩短后全部塞进去。还真是出人意料地强硬呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "f0fb420d5c8e26facdb29f76d37caab894273057b2e619ceee7d7ed63fee1011", "ja": "まあ……、たしかに強引だったけど。\nそれだけ3人の希望が魅力的だったってことだよ。", "zh": "哎……确实是挺强硬的。\n不过这也说明3个人的想法都很吸引人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "b85db43093152190854b53ee7956e396b07f6f48de0638ac8dfe44e06739e9ee", "ja": "まるで示し合わせたみたいに方向性がバラバラで、\n自分のやりたいことがハッキリ分かれてもいて。", "zh": "方向性完全不同，简直就像事先商量好了一样，而且连各自想做的事也都清清楚楚地分开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "6c4b6d0bec5aa6287d72cb2977cda349ab1efbbe5629aaa94d5f1e276f8dc4eb", "ja": "組み合わせてみたら補完し合って、\nピッタリ一つにまとまるぐらいにね。", "zh": "组合起来就能互相补足，甚至恰到好处地融为一体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "8d2ce2253d27debeea0245e78efd2902df432fb9243e7e31d7db215354a2a986", "ja": "3人背中を預け合い、それぞれ前を向いたまま、\n交わらない我が道をどこまでも歩いて行く。", "zh": "3人互相把背后托付给彼此，各自面向前方，\n在互不相交的自我之道上一直走下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "d65f5f800c8487c30cecd6a28792f13fd26eb193d3f7dc860a7d0ef79d624d01", "ja": "迷うこともためらうこともなく、\nお互いがまっすぐ進んでいることを疑いもせずに。", "zh": "没有迷茫，也没有犹豫，丝毫不怀疑彼此都在笔直地前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "040953a933647630aee080128642e72eac184a36c534f18e3c1fa1667aaf62dd", "ja": "それが君達3人……\n『マイペースユニット』なんだろうな。", "zh": "这就是你们这3人……『マイペースユニット』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "d7eceb83916e4326a826de7b6523f3322a1c53e24d38c6034e021daa4577c3a7", "ja": "……爽やかにいろいろ言ってくれていますが、\nレッスンは本当に大変だったんですよ～？", "zh": "……虽然您一副爽朗的样子说了不少好话，\n但练习的时候真的很辛苦哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "edd3e8347cb3ccd015c590421b0f277a7da266ac9742ef5db716471d3833eb0b", "ja": "そうなのです。姫のかよわい足は、\nプルプルになってしまったのです！", "zh": "就是这样。人家纤弱的双腿，都变得直发抖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "6d8870121c2a5ec5adaf7003847c20851b542d80ab767c9f4019050c4362aa0a", "ja": "もしかすると、プロデューサーさんが\n一番マイペースかもしれませんね～♪", "zh": "说不定，制作人先生\n才是最我行我素的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "c1ce4292dca7608f1ece83f1905042c78270b4dfce261ad6808ea4bc4dbab0bf", "ja": "え、そうかな？　うーん……。\nだとしたら、3人に影響されたのかもな？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？嗯……  \n如果真是这样，说不定是受到了3人的影响吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "f2ec3220322d8c880caa758b34a35171bd935f9cee0e4f10c3fc8cf0ceacf753", "ja": "さあ、もう時間だ。\nマイペースでまっすぐに、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好了，时间到了。\n保持自己的步调，坚定地向前走，就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "b16e8641dd765b354f0fbea3e338e9439534d3e183eeef28641d2cab8a5a6091", "ja": "はい～♪/はい～/はいほー！", "zh": "好～♪/好～/嗨哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "259b1273383b0bdb6edb79df720a6038b50ad1640d625fdd6249182573293172", "ja": "はい～。", "zh": "是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_05_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "7a58e255c603ccd5f4698e1d84973f6f7ddf8deb67df775c668a42a792999176", "ja": "はいほー！", "zh": "Hi Ho──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
